     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Adam,<div><br></div><div><div><div>1. 剛才在以下環境測試 , install.packages(&quot;rvest&quot;) 皆正確執行.</div><div><br></div><div><div>Ubuntu 16.04LTS + R-3.3.3 + Studio-1.0.136<br></div><div>Ubuntu 16.04LTS + R-3.4.0 + Studio-1.0.143 (附圖)</div></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-D-VP6sSu4eU/WR5fL49ybaI/AAAAAAAALhM/iAy6oF5x8G83zY3HCeuCSzVF0r74PUHmQCLcB/s1600/ubuntu_rvest.package.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-D-VP6sSu4eU/WR5fL49ybaI/AAAAAAAALhM/iAy6oF5x8G83zY3HCeuCSzVF0r74PUHmQCLcB/s1600/ubuntu_rvest.package.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237678621000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vaX1x1vbpCbADRhbWdtnq\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-D-VP6sSu4eU/WR5fL49ybaI/AAAAAAAALhM/iAy6oF5x8G83zY3HCeuCSzVF0r74PUHmQCLcB/s400/ubuntu_rvest.package.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div>2. 畫面顯示以下套件安裝有錯誤, 問題根源可能是 xml2 一開始無法安裝 </div><div>xml2</div><div>curl</div><div>httr</div></div><div><br></div><div>3. 建議: 在終端機視窗輸入以下二個指令後, 再到 RStudio 看看是否可安裝.<br></div><div><br></div><div>sudo apt-get update<br></div><div>sudo apt-get install r-base-dev libxml2-dev</div><div># end</div></div><br>Adam Wong於 2017年5月19日星期五 UTC+8上午4時25分56秒寫道：</div></div>"
